msgctxt "search2:search2_22C13D51_DBA6_454B_A907_82B7C8844581"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫When I "
"learned my father Antonin had passed, I wrote two letters—⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫one to my brother, "
"and one to my mother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫아버지 앙토"
"냉이 병사한 걸 안 날, ⟪k:16⟫나는…… 형과 어머니에게 편지를 썼다."

#: search2:search2_09F798CD_19DD_43E8_B229_4FF82C14F5C9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb976e188b03007c6c6e0c463f4366e56fc677833f0d6ab2d41e8dd734a8c1ec
#. default-sha256: 89ee5d4393bbf3fda27120058a44256d6227bef191128afca22db7125b6efa51
msgctxt "search2:search2_09F798CD_19DD_43E8_B229_4FF82C14F5C9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was the first time I had found the courage to face my mother...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to open up to "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어머니와―― ⟪k:1⟫처음으로 마주하기로 결심하여……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫어머니에게는 내 모든 마음을…… ⟪k:4⟫써"
"서 보냈다."

#: search2:search2_C22AB7C5_BC01_4088_B00A_EC5515169C4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a2cf588a92cbc767ba6d067dc8b76bc393e2528e7e9a9bde69737b5368b67b6
#. default-sha256: 3cf1c9e37a0cd8eb876c6ddab94723989ee9f77bfc195c446b44277abf16af2d
msgctxt "search2:search2_C22AB7C5_BC01_4088_B00A_EC5515169C4A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I wanted to show her who I was—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫convince her that I wasn’t cursed—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내가 나일 수 있게끔 ⟪k:1⟫증명하려 했다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 저주받지 않았음을――"

